      {
        "factor": "Intelligence assessments that Russia has standardized chemical weapons use (e.g., chloropicrin)",
        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "strong",
        "rationale": "Public intelligence reporting suggests a pattern of repeated use, elevating baseline risk more than other signals."
